            "sid": "JER 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Pashuhuri kabona mutabane wa Immeri, era eyakuliranga eisinzizo, bwe yawulira nga ndi kulangirira ebintu ebyo ku kibuga Yerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaalagira bangeme bankube, era bamale bansibire mu nkoligo. Enkoligo eyo yali kumpi n'omulyango ogw'eitale ogw'eisinzizo ogwetebwa Omulyango gwa Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkyo ku lunaku olwairirira, Pashuhuri bwe yalagira ni bansibulula mu nkoligo, nze naamukoba nti: “Musengwa Katonda takaakweta liina lyo Pashuhuri, aye aidha kukwetanga ‘Entiisa Egemye Bulighantu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda mwene akobye ati, ‘Bona, ndidha kukufuula ekintu ekitiisa eri iwe mwene n'eri bakagwa bo, era olibona nga boonaboona baitibwa abazigu baibwe mu lutalo. Nja kughaayo abantu b'omu Buyudaaya boonaboona mu ngalo dha kyabazinga w'e Babilonia. Abandi alibatwala e Babilonia ng'abanhage, ate abandi yaabaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era nja kuleka abazigu baimwe banhage eby'obukombe byaimwe byonabyona ebiri mu kibuga muno, n'ebintu abantu bye baafaabiikanira, n'eby'omughendo einho omuli n'ebya bakyabazinga ab'omu Buyudaaya. Ebyo byonabyona abazigu abo balibinhaga baabitwala e Babilonia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'iwe Pashuhuri, balikugema baakutwala e Babilonia ghalala n'ab'omu maka go boonaboona. Era eyo y'olifiira, waaziikibwa iwe ni bakagwa bo boonaboona be wakoberanga obulanzi obw'obuguya.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
